('es', 'pronlesson.a51ab9f4-0b01-4e12-b103-ac58ee67570b|note|12', 'Practica la respiración antes de ''you give your listeners''.'),
('es', 'pronlesson.a51ab9f4-0b01-4e12-b103-ac58ee67570b|note|13', 'Enlaza ''just as importantly'' sin esfuerzo.'),
