('es', 'pronlesson.a51ab9f4-0b01-4e12-b103-ac58ee67570b|note|26', 'Enlaza ''how we learn, work, and create''.'),
('es', 'pronlesson.a51ab9f4-0b01-4e12-b103-ac58ee67570b|note|27', 'Triada fluida a través de los objetos coordinados.'),
('es', 'pronlesson.a51ab9f4-0b01-4e12-b103-ac58ee67570b|note|28', 'Desliza a través de ''sustainable strategies''.'),
