('es', 'pronlesson.a51ab9f4-0b01-4e12-b103-ac58ee67570b|note|44', 'Pronuncia con convicción serena y flujo continuo.'),
('es', 'pronlesson.a51ab9f4-0b01-4e12-b103-ac58ee67570b|note|45', 'Deslizamiento impecable a través de ''transforms your self-perception forever''.'),
('es', 'pronlesson.a51ab9f4-0b01-4e12-b103-ac58ee67570b|note|46', 'Pronuncia ''carry an authenticity'' con resonancia firme.'),
('es', 'pronlesson.a51ab9f4-0b01-4e12-b103-ac58ee67570b|note|47', 'Desliza suavemente a través de ''connect, inspire, and share''.'),
