('es', 'pronlesson.5b03a85a-0d23-44a4-b9b5-647d6e65d86f|point|1', 'give it to me → gimme that'),
('es', 'pronlesson.5b03a85a-0d23-44a4-b9b5-647d6e65d86f|point|2', 'you all → y''all'),
