('es', 'pronlesson.a7401fe9-f40d-48db-b8b1-0dd59612c866|note|2', 'Acento en el phrasal verb ''pick up'' y en ''airport''.'),
('es', 'pronlesson.a7401fe9-f40d-48db-b8b1-0dd59612c866|note|3', 'Las palabras gramaticales ''we'', ''to'', ''the'' son rápidas y suaves.'),
