('zh-CN', 'pronlesson.36c7ad3a-bbc7-40a8-a000-7f316edba35e|note|8', '目的从句后接祈使动作。'),
('zh-CN', 'pronlesson.36c7ad3a-bbc7-40a8-a000-7f316edba35e|note|9', '停顿标记时间过渡。'),
('zh-CN', 'pronlesson.36c7ad3a-bbc7-40a8-a000-7f316edba35e|note|10', '非限定性关系从句由停顿包围。'),
