('zh-CN', 'pronlesson.36c7ad3a-bbc7-40a8-a000-7f316edba35e|note|12', '对比性插入短语单独隔开。'),
('zh-CN', 'pronlesson.36c7ad3a-bbc7-40a8-a000-7f316edba35e|note|13', '同位语不定式短语由停顿括起。'),
('zh-CN', 'pronlesson.36c7ad3a-bbc7-40a8-a000-7f316edba35e|note|14', '分词描述性语块。'),
('zh-CN', 'pronlesson.36c7ad3a-bbc7-40a8-a000-7f316edba35e|note|15', '四个均衡的修辞语块。'),
('zh-CN', 'pronlesson.36c7ad3a-bbc7-40a8-a000-7f316edba35e|note|16', '逐步程序性切分。'),
('zh-CN', 'pronlesson.36c7ad3a-bbc7-40a8-a000-7f316edba35e|note|17', '关联连词形成节奏性停顿。'),
('zh-CN', 'pronlesson.36c7ad3a-bbc7-40a8-a000-7f316edba35e|note|18', '倒装平行结构整齐划分。'),
('zh-CN', 'pronlesson.36c7ad3a-bbc7-40a8-a000-7f316edba35e|note|19', '两个紧迫选项之间停顿。'),
('zh-CN', 'pronlesson.36c7ad3a-bbc7-40a8-a000-7f316edba35e|note|20', '公开演讲：称呼语块、感谢语块、时间语块。'),
