('hi', 'pronlesson.a7401fe9-f40d-48db-b8b1-0dd59612c866|note|16', '''should'', ''a'', ''of'' reduced हैं; ''grab'', ''cup'', ''coffee'' पर ज़ोर।'),
('hi', 'pronlesson.a7401fe9-f40d-48db-b8b1-0dd59612c866|note|17', 'चार स्पष्ट peaks: ''left'', ''wallet'', ''kitchen'', ''table''।'),
('hi', 'pronlesson.a7401fe9-f40d-48db-b8b1-0dd59612c866|note|18', 'Question word ''why'', ''didn''t'', ''tell'', ''this''।'),
