('id', 'pronlesson.551b9527-f712-421d-966c-24644f360746|explain', 'Reduksi sapaan sehari-hari tambahan di luar what''s up / how''s it going.'),
('id', 'pronlesson.551b9527-f712-421d-966c-24644f360746|point|0', 'how are you → how ya doin'''),
('id', 'pronlesson.551b9527-f712-421d-966c-24644f360746|point|1', 'good to see you → good to see ya'),
('id', 'pronlesson.551b9527-f712-421d-966c-24644f360746|caution', 'Hanya bentuk lisan santai.'),
('id', 'pronlesson.b855faed-9428-4a1b-b95c-1e0c3b2d30c8|explain', 'Reduksi kewajiban dan keinginan lainnya yang umum dalam percakapan santai orang Amerika.'),
