('nl', 'pronlesson.2856e155-9edf-4a4e-9b05-c66ea6dac7d1|point|1', 'going to need → gonna need'),
('nl', 'pronlesson.2856e155-9edf-4a4e-9b05-c66ea6dac7d1|caution', 'Alleen informeel gesproken.'),
('nl', 'pronlesson.233cf355-0eca-4443-9a49-65fb7f9946ac|explain', '''Ain''t'' vervangt am not/is not/are not/has not/have not in zeer informeel taalgebruik en is overal te horen in liedjes en informele gesprekken.'),
