('da', 'pronlesson.0269fc6d-11c6-4667-9e5f-34ff1033bcf6|point|2', 'anything → anythin'''),
('da', 'pronlesson.0269fc6d-11c6-4667-9e5f-34ff1033bcf6|caution', 'Kun i afslappet tale.'),
('da', 'pronlesson.cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|explain', '''Them'' reduceres til ''em (''th'' forsvinder) efter et verbum i meget almindelig afslappet tale.'),
('da', 'pronlesson.cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|point|0', 'tell them → tell ''em'),
('da', 'pronlesson.cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|point|1', 'get them → get ''em'),
('da', 'pronlesson.cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|point|2', 'ask them → ask ''em'),
('da', 'pronlesson.cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|caution', 'Kun uformelt talt sprog — sig ''them'' i fuld form i skrift eller formel tale.'),
('da', 'pronlesson.66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|explain', '''And'' reduceres til en hurtig ''n''-lyd mellem to tæt forbundne ord, især i faste vendinger.'),
('da', 'pronlesson.66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|point|0', 'rock and roll → rock ''n'' roll'),
('da', 'pronlesson.66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|point|1', 'fish and chips → fish ''n'' chips'),
('da', 'pronlesson.66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|point|2', 'back and forth → back ''n'' forth'),
('da', 'pronlesson.66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|caution', 'Almindeligt i faste vendinger og hurtig tale — skriv ''and'' tydeligt i formel skrift.'),
('da', 'pronlesson.74f83968-80ee-48d6-8255-ecd4ed9c9028|explain', '''Because'' alene (ikke kun ''because of'') forkortes ofte til ''cause i afslappede svar.'),
('da', 'pronlesson.74f83968-80ee-48d6-8255-ecd4ed9c9028|point|0', 'because → ''cause'),
('da', 'pronlesson.74f83968-80ee-48d6-8255-ecd4ed9c9028|caution', 'Kun uformelt talt sprog — skriv ''because'' i fuld form ellers.'),
('da', 'pronlesson.f8740e37-88d7-4e64-a74d-762766ff4593|explain', '''Of course'' dropper ofte det første ord i hurtige, afslappede svar.'),
